notes.content:
[b]Hi everybody,
Thanks to your advices and suggestions for the last DEMO, we performed a comprehensive optimization of the game. You can play the BRAND NEW DEMO right now!
[/b]

V0.6.6.9

Major Updates
1.DEMO version of the story simplified;
2. Complete replacement of character drawing, new school uniform drawing;
3. Optimization of part of the story copy;
4. Change the CV of Tianchen Zhan character, and replace the corresponding dubbing of some characters according to the copy modification;
5. Sharpness or texture optimization of some character drawing, background picture, FG, CG;
6. Several performance improvements;
7. Improve the performance of the main menu of the game and the corridor gameplay;
8. Corridor gameplay UI adjustment;
9. Add DEMO special transitional text performance effect;
10. Added a skip option for the performance of the text at the beginning of the chapter and the performance of the transitional text;
11. Read files and mute when death returns to checkpoint;
12. Modify incorrect characters

Other Updates
1. Dialog box HD;
2. Select UI font size; 
3. Font changes in some menus, historical review, map UI in the upper left corner of gameplay, etc.;
4. Add auto-save point prompt;
5. Fix some gameplay bugs;
6. Select Suspension effect from the main menu and add flicker effect; 

If you have any questions about the game, please join the official QQ group: 127843809.
